.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"On visiting the Moon, Beatrice explains to Dante the reasons for its markings, Canto 2.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFullMoon2010.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Philipp_Veit_004.jpg/500px-Philipp_Veit_004.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Philipp_Veit_004.jpg/1280px-Philipp_Veit_004.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Philipp_Veit_004.jpg/500px-Philipp_Veit_004.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dante and Beatrice speak to Piccarda and Constance (fresco by Philipp Veit), Canto 3.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhilipp_Veit_004.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Mosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_%28Ravenna%29.jpg/500px-Mosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_%28Ravenna%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Mosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_%28Ravenna%29.jpg/1280px-Mosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_%28Ravenna%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Mosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_%28Ravenna%29.jpg/500px-Mosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_%28Ravenna%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dante meets the Emperor Justinian in the Sphere of Mercury, Canto 5.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMosaic_of_Justinianus_I_-_Basilica_San_Vitale_(Ravenna).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Para